### Create Class (admin)
POST http://localhost:3600/api/classes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "class_name": "Grade 10A"
}

###

### Create Another Class (admin)
POST http://localhost:3600/api/classes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "class_name": "Grade 11B"
}

###

### Get All Classes
GET http://localhost:3600/api/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### Rename Class (admin)
PATCH http://localhost:3600/api/classes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "class_name": "Grade 10A (Renamed)"
}

###

### Delete Class (admin)
DELETE http://localhost:3600/api/classes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}